# CTRL — Project Overview

CTRL is a POS/admin platform. Brand vibe: **black background, white text, green accent `#8EFF19`**, minimal and focused. Brand name is `CTRL`, motto `Stay in CTRL.` (both configurable via the root `.env`).

## Stack
- **Frontend**: React (Vite) + TailwindCSS, in `frontend/`
- **Backend**: FastAPI (Python), in `backend/`, runs on port `2830` (configurable via `.env`)
- **Database**: MySQL / MariaDB (XAMPP), schema in `database/`

## Configuration
Most configuration lives in the **root `/.env`**:
- Theme colors (`VITE_THEME_*`)
- Frontend API base URL (`VITE_API_BASE_URL`)
- Backend host/port (`BACKEND_HOST`, `BACKEND_PORT`)
- **All DB connection info, stored AES-256 encrypted** (`DB_*_ENC`)
- `VITE_BRAND_*` — bootstrap **fallback** only.

Two things are intentionally NOT in `.env`:
- **Brand name & motto** are stored in the DB `settings` table (`brand_name`, `brand_motto`), editable at runtime via `GET/PUT /brand`. The frontend fetches them through `BrandContext`.
- **Auth/JWT config** is embedded in `backend/app/core/security.py` (like the AES key), never in `.env`.

Vite is configured with `envDir: '../'` so the frontend reads the root `.env`. The backend loads the root `.env` via `python-dotenv`.

## Design & template references (read-only)
- `ref/design/` — brand look/feel (CTRL wordmark, green `#8EFF19` accent, dark theme).
- `ref/template/` — Reback admin template. Reuse layouts/pages (e.g. `SignIn2`) but re-implement them in React + Tailwind, adapted to the CTRL theme. Never ship template files directly.

## Roles (ascending privilege)
`Cashier` < `Moderator` < `Admin` < `SuperAdmin`. The seed SuperAdmin (`admin` / `Oselfasads@eshta`) is defined — bcrypt-hashed — in `database/db.sql`, not in `.env`.

## Non-negotiables
- Every meaningful action is logged (see `action-logging` rule).
- The app is bilingual **English + Arabic** with full RTL support, extensible to more languages (see `i18n` rule).
- Keep everything **modular and reusable**; brand/logo/colors must stay configurable.
